vector with `∑_s f(s) w(s + d) = δ(d, 0)` in `ZMod 389`, where `f(s) = 256 ^ φ(s)`, and
`f(s) = 256 ^ φ(s) + 1` for the permutation. `E6SumTasks` and `E6PermAdd` check them in the kernel.
`permTable` is the permutation of the task `perm-add`.
-/

